  + resource "aws_iam_role" "eks_sa_role" { }
  # aws_kms_key.ns_key["staging"] will be created
  + resource "aws_kms_key" "ns_key" { }
Plan: 2 to add, 0 to change, 0 to destroy.
```

maria.chen: looks good. alex, open a PR with the role-per-namespace pattern and include integration test showing a pod can decrypt. I can review and sign off today.

alex.ng: Will do, thx both. I'll also add a note in the module docs explaining why aws:PrincipalTag route was rejected (IRSA doesn't surface session tags automatically). :white_check_mark:
